<p>Ek bekaso ghareeb ka kunba ujad gaya <br />
godi ujad gayi koi jhoola ujad gaya<br />
Ae arze karbala teri godi me aan kar <br />
Farzande fatima ka bhara ghar ujad gaya</p>

<p>Paani na mila fatima ke noore ain ko <br />
darya taras ke reh gaya pyase hussain ko<br />
bache atash se maahiye be aab hogaye<br />
aaqar tadap ke mout ki godi me sogaye</p>

<p>laila ka chand zulm ki badli me chup gaya<br />
naiza jigar pa khaake jawani me mar gaya<br />
kya mout thi khuda ki qasam dil dahal gaye<br />
do hichkiyo'n pa qaak me armaan mil gaye</p>

<p>abbas jis ke dam se tha sarwar ko itmenaan <br />
Thi jis ke dam se fouje hussaini ki aan baan<br />
shaane kata ke sher taraayi me so gaya<br />
Zainab ki lo aseeri ka samaan ho gaya</p>

<p>Jhoole me khelta hua bacha hussain ka <br />
do din ki bhook o pyaas me kumbhlaa ke reh gaya<br />
sookhi zabaa'n dikhaane pa ek hashr ho gaya<br />
Ek teer aaya halq chida dam nikal gaya</p>

<p>Shabbar ka laal aur wo nairangi-e- jahaa'n<br />
Mout aayi kaise waqt me dulha bana kahaa'n<br />
Sehra ulat ke haq ki himaayat me kya gaya<br />
Dulha ka jism ghodo'n se paamaal ho gaya</p>

<p>Wo dhoop aur wo pyaas ka toofaan al'amaa'n<br />
Zaqmo'n se choor fatima ki jaan al'amaa'n<br />
tapti hui zamee'n pa jo tyora ke gir pada<br />
Sambhla na tha ke tan se juda sar bhi ho gaya</p>

